<h1>Niki Conforti</h1>
<p>US House, 6th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican.</p>
<p><a href="https://conforti4congress.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (conforti4congress.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Conforti says affordability is the district&#39;s most critical issue and lists cutting energy regulations, increasing transparency in medical billing, and bringing manufacturing back to the district through workforce training as her three priorities. Her campaign site lists opposition to raising the debt ceiling, support for tariffs, expanding ICE and deporting violent criminals, stronger penalties for fentanyl crimes, and a photo ID requirement to vote. She describes herself as pro-life with exceptions for rape, incest, and the life of the mother, and supports term limits for House members.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Energy consultant since 2017 with earlier work as a director in the health care industry, and the 2024 Republican nominee for this seat.</p>
